              "text": "Dermal infiltrate—polymorphous; malignant upon stage of disease at diagnosis, therapeutic lymphocytes may obscure the dermoepidermal choice, and response to therapy; median junction; patch and plaque stages, limited to 6 months (range 1 month–2 years). the superficial dermis; nodular stage, extends to",
